OL,3,APension and benefits services still
OL,4,Aoffline after 'cyber incident' hits DWP
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork and Pensions Secretary Pat
OL,7,FMcFadden says investigations are
OL,8,Fongoing into a "serious cyber incident"
OL,9,Faffecting his government department
OL,11,FThere's currently no suggestion
OL,12,Fpersonal data has been lost, Downing
OL,13,FStreet says; "malicious" activity
OL,14,Fhasn't been ruled out - read more
OL,16,FThe Department for Work and Pensions
OL,17,Ftook pension, universal credit and Pip
OL,18,Fservices offline earlier as a
OL,19,F"precaution"
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
