OL,3,APension and benefits services still
OL,4,Aoffline after 'cyber incident' hits DWP
OL,5,
OL,6,FRegular benefit and pension payments
OL,7,Fare not affected and will be paid as
OL,8,Fnormal, the department says
OL,10,FGemma, 34, says she has just #30 left
OL,11,Fin her bank account and worries her
OL,12,Fpayments could be cut if she fails to
OL,13,Ffill out her universal credit journal -
OL,14,Fbut DWP confirms people in situations
OL,15,Flike hers will not be sanctioned
OL,17,FOur correspondent says cyber incident
OL,18,Fhas become a catch-all term used in the
OL,19,Fearly stages of what often ends up
OL,20,Fbeing a cyber attack - here's the
OL,21,Fdifference
